OL,3,GNEWSAAI trial aims to detect depression
OL,4,Ain new mothers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medical study is testing whether
OL,7,FArtificial Intelligence (AI) could be
OL,8,Fused to detect depression in pregnant
OL,9,Fwomen or those who have recently given
OL,10,Fbirth.
OL,12,FResearchers from the University of
OL,13,FNottingham and Nottinghamshire
OL,14,FHealthcare NHS Foundation Trust have
OL,15,Fworked with AI firm Blueskeye to
OL,16,Fdevelop an app that tracks
OL,17,Fparticipants' mood and behaviour.
OL,19,FThe app works by asking users to
OL,20,Fcomplete tasks while software analyses
OL,21,Ftheir facial expressions, speech and
OL,22,Fautomatic movements.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
